# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This is not cosmetic. The exact-file duplicate check hashes the bytes of a
# fixture, and the generator writes LF. If Git checked these files out with
# CRLF on Windows, a regenerated fixture would differ from the committed one
# and the two byte-identical duplicate fixtures would only agree by accident.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never converted.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pbix binary
